    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、すごくよかったと思うけど\r\n恋鐘はあんまり嬉しくなさそうだからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030310,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ん～ん、うれしかよ！\r\nうれしかばってん、改めてこうやって見て……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030320,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "インタビューって、難しか～って\r\n考えよったと！",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030330,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ぱっと思いついたことなんでも答えればよか～って、\r\nそういうのは得意って思っとったばってん",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030340,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それだけじゃだめとかも～って\r\n考えとったとよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "恋鐘が成長してる\r\nってことだな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "恋鐘の視野が\r\n広がったのかもな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "恋鐘はすごいな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だって、見てくれる人のことを考えて\r\n答えられるようになったってことだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030350,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふぇ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘はもともとそれが\r\n出来てないわけじゃなかったけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "無自覚に、感覚的にやっていたことが\r\n自覚的にできるようになったってことだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルとしてまたひとつ\r\n成長できたな",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030360,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……んふふ～、そうやね",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030360"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030370,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "インタビューば受けたら\r\nうちの右に出るもんはもうおらんね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030370"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうふうに\r\n考えられるってことは、きっとそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030380,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふぇ……\r\nそがん立派なことじゃなかよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030380"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030390,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "思ったことそのまま言えん～って時も\r\nあるとかもって、思っただけばい",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030390"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、だからかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『普段言えない気持ちを伝えられるように\r\n応援してる』って言葉、すごく印象的だったよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030400,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん～\r\n……きっと、そうやね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030400"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "毎回の仕事を通して\r\n色んなことを吸収して、成長して",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どんどん視野が\r\n広がってるんだろうなって、見ていて思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030410,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030410"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030420,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プロデューサーには\r\nうちがそがんふうに見えとるとやね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030420"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "逆に恋鐘の目には、\r\nどういう世界が見えてるんだろうとも思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030430,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "…………\r\nうちは、プロデューサーが見えとるとよ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400903/2004009030430"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それは今の話だろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009030440,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
